35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, the statements reveal a wild swing: February costs nearly three times August. We must design for the peak, not the average.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, that swing explains the late payments. The log shows three months settled late, right after someone questioned a sudden change. The friction is real.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, that swing is huge! And the monitor showed one room uses four times more than another. I just want to know if the old split is really fair for everyone now.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, four times more? That’s brutal. But the electrician wants thirty-four thousand yen per room just to fix it. That’s a massive upfront hit.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minato, that’s a lot of work. The template meant keying in every invoice and computing five refunds separately. It’s a huge time sink.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, a system that demands hours of calculation is a system that fails. We need simplicity that respects our time, not just our wallets.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I hear you. The log shows the late payments happened right after the arguments. If the math is too hard, the trust breaks. We need a system that is easy enough to keep us talking.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Daisuke, that sounds really tiring. I just want a way that is easy for everyone, so nobody feels like they are doing too much work.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, if the template eats your evenings, I’m not signing up for it. I need a system that doesn’t require a degree in accounting just to survive winter.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I agree. The template is too heavy. I’m worried it will become a monthly job for whoever is least able to say no.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, the thirty-four thousand yen is a barrier, not a solution. We must find a way to share the warmth without building walls of debt between us.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, I hear your worry. But the kitchen notice showed people sweating rather than arguing over a pooled bill. We need a system that keeps us comfortable without turning us against each other.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@May, I understand the worry about the cost. But if one room uses four times more, is it fair to split it evenly? I just want to know the truth.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, it’s not fair, but I can’t afford thirty-four thousand yen per room right now. I need to know if we can survive the winter swing without that massive upfront cost.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minato, I agree. If the math is too hard, people stop paying. I just want a way that doesn’t steal our evenings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, the monitor reveals the truth, but the winter habits show a deeper lesson. If we fix the cost ahead, we stop counting every switch. Let us design for peace, not just precision.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree. The cooler notice proved that comfort shouldn’t cost us our friendship. Let’s find a way to share the warmth without the resentment.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, that sounds peaceful. I just want to make sure the numbers match the truth, so nobody feels like they are carrying too much.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Servas, peace is lovely, but I can’t pay for it with debt. I need a plan that handles the winter spike without the electrician’s massive upfront fee.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, I agree. I just want to make sure the system is simple enough that it doesn’t become a monthly burden for one person.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
